# Local Croupier sessions

Follow **Local servers and browser tabs** in the repository's `AGENTS.md`.
Start with `node apps/studio/start.mjs`; it starts no local servers. The offline
comparison, connected pair and their session guard are retired (2026-10-27).
From Codex, pass `--no-open`, then inspect and reuse the
connected browser's existing game/lab tabs. A matching URL needs reload, not a
duplicate tab; replace an older URL in that same tab after preserving
in-progress input. When the user requests shutdown, leave the servers stopped.
